 "remarks": "In the heart of New Canaan, The Quartier presents 21 bespoke luxury residences that pairs classic architecture and natural materials with sustainable energy features such as rainwater harvesting, solar energy, and native landscaping. This thoughtfully-designed 3-bedroom, 3-full and 1-half bath Townhome offers 3,261 square feet and a private outdoor terrace area with gorgeous views off the spacious living room with fireplace, oversized windows and doors, private elevator to all levels, 7\" white oak flooring and attached 2-car garage parking. Chef's kitchen with Leicht cabinets, quartzite counters and state-of-the-art appliances. A private primary suite with spa-like bath and walk-in closet on the top level with cathedral ceilings and den with fireplace. This refined, boutique development includes a full suite of modern amenities. Residents enjoy two luxurious lobbies with a full-time concierge, exclusive access to a professional fitness studio, a dog grooming station, an entertainment lounge with catering kitchen, a state-of-the-art sports simulator, outdoor grilling station and firepit, secure and convenient bicycle storage and advanced building security. Located just steps from world-class dining, boutique shopping, and the NYC train line. The Quartier offers luxury, convenience, and connection-all in one. Timeless luxury reimagined for modern living.",
